  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EKELGA ASSOCIATION FOR WELFARE AND DEVELOPMENT women, peace and security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to advocate for a sustainable urban water and sanitation governance system for the people of Bayelsa state, especially those living in Yenagoa and its environs. The project will engage water and sanitation agencies of the Bayelsa state government and funders of urban water and sanitation project, namely the World Bank, The EU, and the Government of Nigeria to ensure due diligence in the utilization of funds appropriated for water projects. The objective is to ensure that the people enjoy adequate water and sanitation facilities through the completion of all abandoned projects.</narrative>
  </description>
